WEBVTT

01:25.720 --> 01:28.080
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:41.320 --> 01:42.680
First time riding a carriage?

01:48.600 --> 01:50.480
Liquor!

01:50.560 --> 01:52.760
Finest liquor!

02:02.320 --> 02:03.400
It's gold bullion.

02:05.360 --> 02:06.600
It's all gold bullion here?

02:08.560 --> 02:11.720
We're carrying so much gold bullion
to buy pearls?

02:13.440 --> 02:14.680
Master has his reasons.

02:23.080 --> 02:24.280
What's wrong, Accountant Wei?

02:26.160 --> 02:27.360
My stomach aches…

02:27.960 --> 02:30.560
-I… I'll tell the coachman…
-No need!

02:31.240 --> 02:32.560
This deal with Shi Nawei is too crucial.

02:32.640 --> 02:34.000
If someone else beats us to it,

02:34.080 --> 02:35.440
we won't be able to bear the blame.

02:37.640 --> 02:38.760
Then, what should we do?

02:39.760 --> 02:41.920
When we get there later,
you go ahead first.

02:42.640 --> 02:43.960
I go alone?

02:44.040 --> 02:45.600
The Master's deposit is more than enough.

02:45.680 --> 02:46.920
-There won't be any issues.
-But…

02:47.520 --> 02:48.560
Here.

02:53.760 --> 02:55.400
You worthless scum!

02:55.480 --> 02:57.440
After all this beating,
you're still tough?

02:57.520 --> 03:01.120
If you can't find Duanwu,
she'll be collecting your corpse!

03:01.200 --> 03:03.120
Hit him harder!

03:05.800 --> 03:06.720
Go find Duanwu!

03:06.800 --> 03:08.440
No one's allowed to go…

03:10.320 --> 03:12.160
Don't let her know.

03:13.120 --> 03:14.560
Either kill me

03:15.560 --> 03:18.240
or wait till she comes back
to finish you off!

03:20.760 --> 03:23.040
-I beg you…
-Why beg me? Go beg Duanwu instead!

03:23.120 --> 03:24.000
Please…

03:34.880 --> 03:37.800
HAIYANG HALL

03:37.880 --> 03:39.760
The land of Great Tang is truly blessed!

03:39.840 --> 03:41.920
I am Shi Nawei,

03:42.000 --> 03:43.440
from a kingdom in the Southern Sea.

03:46.440 --> 03:47.720
This welcoming wine of the Great Tang

03:47.800 --> 03:49.520
is specially for honored guests from afar.

03:49.600 --> 03:52.040
I am Cui Shijiu. Please.

03:55.720 --> 03:58.120
GRACIOUS COURTYARD OF ORCHIDS AND JADE

03:58.200 --> 03:59.080
Excellent wine!

04:00.400 --> 04:04.040
You speak Tang's language fluently.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.560
You must frequent Guangzhou.

04:05.640 --> 04:07.920
I often sail this sea route

04:08.000 --> 04:09.640
between Zhenla, Linyi, Funan,

04:09.720 --> 04:12.320
and Guangzhou.

04:12.400 --> 04:14.680
I heard you've brought
a batch of treasures

04:14.760 --> 04:16.600
on this trip to Guangzhou.

04:16.680 --> 04:19.120
Might we have a glimpse?

04:43.320 --> 04:44.280
Pearls from the South Seas,

04:45.280 --> 04:46.560
large and full,

04:46.640 --> 04:47.960
perfectly round.

04:48.040 --> 04:49.040
Truly remarkable.

04:49.120 --> 04:51.560
Master Shijiu, you have a keen eye.

04:51.640 --> 04:53.840
The Cui family dominates the southeast,

04:53.920 --> 04:55.120
with unmatched wealth.

04:55.200 --> 04:58.600
You've brought so many pearls.
If you wish to sell them all,

04:59.480 --> 05:01.400
may I ask, aside from my family,

05:02.040 --> 05:03.760
who else could buy them in one go?

05:05.920 --> 05:07.160
Why not name your price?

05:07.240 --> 05:09.080
Master Shijiu, you're truly bold!

05:10.000 --> 05:11.360
-Then let's--
-Wait!

05:13.160 --> 05:14.000
Yan's Trading Convoy

05:14.080 --> 05:16.880
offers the highest price
and places a deposit on the spot.

05:17.720 --> 05:18.840
It's you again!

05:18.920 --> 05:20.040
What?

05:20.120 --> 05:23.480
Isn't Yan Zijing's reach
over Lady Wu's Zhuobao House enough?

05:23.560 --> 05:24.800
Now you want

05:24.880 --> 05:26.560
to claim the pearls here, too?

05:26.640 --> 05:28.160
Aren't you afraid
you'll eat yourself to death?

05:32.480 --> 05:34.160
Looks like running away from me

05:34.720 --> 05:37.360
to be Yan Zijing's lackey
has really paid off for you.

05:38.040 --> 05:40.160
Too bad. No matter how fine your clothes,

05:40.240 --> 05:42.120
you still look like a maid.

05:45.360 --> 05:46.440
Yan's Trading Convoy

05:47.880 --> 05:49.760
offers the highest price

05:50.640 --> 05:51.520
and places a deposit on the spot.

05:59.880 --> 06:01.840
Mr. Shi, what do you say?

06:04.000 --> 06:05.440
I brought the deposit today.

06:21.080 --> 06:23.320
Is the deposit too heavy,

06:23.400 --> 06:25.120
or are you embarrassed to take it out?

06:25.720 --> 06:26.640
What is the meaning of this?

06:34.120 --> 06:35.400
It's just a deposit.

06:37.560 --> 06:40.440
How could Mr. Shi even care
about such a small sum?

06:43.760 --> 06:45.680
An idea just came to me.

06:46.760 --> 06:48.840
With your pearls, Mr. Shi,

06:48.920 --> 06:50.480
they're certainly valuable as they are,

06:51.360 --> 06:53.000
but if made into jewelry,

06:53.960 --> 06:55.240
they would fetch

06:55.320 --> 06:57.080
twice the price.

06:57.160 --> 06:58.080
For instance,

06:59.200 --> 07:00.880
hairpins beloved by ladies

07:02.040 --> 07:04.760
adorned with your pearls,

07:04.840 --> 07:06.920
they would be a unique sight.

07:13.280 --> 07:14.640
Mr. Shi.

07:14.720 --> 07:16.280
-Don't listen to her--
-Hold on.

07:17.720 --> 07:20.640
This idea is quite interesting.

07:21.640 --> 07:23.840
But talk is cheap.

07:23.920 --> 07:26.160
How can I be sure you can make

07:26.240 --> 07:27.360
beautiful pearl-adorned hairpins?

07:27.440 --> 07:30.000
Yan's Trading Convoy offers

07:30.080 --> 07:31.280
a wide variety,

07:31.360 --> 07:33.760
over 30 styles.

07:33.840 --> 07:35.440
If you're interested,

07:35.520 --> 07:36.760
you may return with me,

07:36.840 --> 07:37.800
and I can show them to you.

07:37.880 --> 07:40.040
-There are actual pieces?
-Yes, finished pieces.

07:40.120 --> 07:42.560
Craftsmen, skills, styles, designs…

07:43.080 --> 07:45.080
Yan's Trading Convoy provides them all.

07:46.480 --> 07:49.440
If you can bring samples tomorrow,

07:49.520 --> 07:51.200
and they are as promised,

07:51.280 --> 07:52.960
we've got a deal.

07:53.720 --> 07:56.160
Perhaps we can sign a contract now.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.560
Duanwu,

07:57.640 --> 07:59.120
you have neither a deposit nor samples,

07:59.200 --> 08:00.240
yet you still wish to make a contract?

08:02.440 --> 08:05.720
Rest assured, I'm a person of my word.

08:05.800 --> 08:07.360
As you Han people say,

08:07.440 --> 08:09.400
"A promise is worth its weight in gold."

08:09.960 --> 08:12.240
As long as I'm satisfied with the samples,

08:12.320 --> 08:13.480
I'll sign the contract immediately.

08:13.560 --> 08:15.400
-Master Shijiu, this--
-Fine.

08:20.800 --> 08:21.640
It's a deal.

08:25.000 --> 08:26.520
You're back so early today?

08:31.120 --> 08:31.960
Duanwu.

08:33.039 --> 08:34.080
What's wrong?

08:35.440 --> 08:36.480
I…

08:37.280 --> 08:38.480
Shrimp…

08:39.640 --> 08:40.679
I'm sorry.

08:47.800 --> 08:48.640
Sister…

09:00.120 --> 09:01.200
Sister…

09:07.560 --> 09:08.680
Who did this?

09:10.960 --> 09:12.680
Tell me. Who did this?

09:17.880 --> 09:19.800
Who did this?!

09:19.880 --> 09:21.560
Pang Song and Cao.

09:21.640 --> 09:23.040
Why?

09:23.120 --> 09:24.720
They knew you were out on business,

09:24.800 --> 09:27.920
and they caused trouble,
using Shrimp to threaten you.

09:28.000 --> 09:29.240
I begged him… Duanwu!

09:29.320 --> 09:30.680
-Duanwu! Duanwu!
-Sister!

09:30.760 --> 09:32.360
-Duanwu!
-Let me go!

09:32.440 --> 09:33.280
Sister…

09:33.360 --> 09:37.440
-Shrimp is awake.
-Sister…

09:41.240 --> 09:43.000
I'm here…

09:44.800 --> 09:45.680
Don't go…

09:46.800 --> 09:48.240
Don't go…

09:50.320 --> 09:51.400
Does it hurt?

09:52.920 --> 09:55.800
You worked so hard to get here.

09:55.880 --> 09:58.560
I know how much you've suffered.

09:59.960 --> 10:01.400
You've endured so much hardship,

10:02.280 --> 10:03.960
so much pain,

10:04.480 --> 10:06.120
just to reach this day.

10:06.920 --> 10:08.920
Don't lose it all

10:09.000 --> 10:10.640
over me.

10:12.000 --> 10:13.960
I worry about you.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.200
Good Shrimp,

10:32.280 --> 10:33.360
you're so sensible.

10:33.880 --> 10:35.080
I know…

10:41.400 --> 10:42.800
And I won't let you get hurt for nothing.

10:44.320 --> 10:45.760
Sister…

10:58.120 --> 10:59.760
Master, why did you bind me?

11:01.240 --> 11:03.360
You betrayed the convoy and still deny it?

11:04.280 --> 11:07.120
-Don't you know what kind of person I am?
-Still trying to argue?

11:09.080 --> 11:11.600
Duanwu, you're here just in time.

11:12.200 --> 11:15.200
Today, you'll see the price
of betraying the convoy.

11:15.280 --> 11:16.960
Master, I didn't!

11:17.040 --> 11:17.880
I…

11:18.560 --> 11:20.920
Master, perhaps this needs
further investigation.

11:21.000 --> 11:23.280
Accountant Wei may have been framed

11:23.360 --> 11:25.880
-by someone--
-I found this deed in her room.

11:25.960 --> 11:27.280
It's from the Cui family.

11:27.960 --> 11:30.920
The deed is for
one of the top jewelry shops in Yangzhou.

11:31.880 --> 11:34.360
Seems Cui Shijiu spared no expense on you.

11:35.640 --> 11:36.680
-Guards!
-Yes, sir.

11:37.600 --> 11:39.080
-Take her away and execute her.
-Yes, sir!

11:41.880 --> 11:43.480
Wait!

11:43.560 --> 11:44.400
Master!

11:44.920 --> 11:46.080
This matter needs further investigation!

11:46.160 --> 11:48.800
-Speak up! Say something!
-Stop!

11:58.720 --> 11:59.560
Yan Zijing,

12:01.280 --> 12:02.800
why show such disregard for life?

12:02.880 --> 12:04.600
This is my convoy.

12:05.480 --> 12:06.960
When they boarded the ship,

12:07.040 --> 12:08.360
they signed a contract.

12:08.880 --> 12:11.000
Their lives belong to me.

12:11.080 --> 12:14.160
But this is Tang territory,
under Tang law.

12:15.400 --> 12:16.800
If you persist,

12:17.840 --> 12:19.600
I'll have no choice but to report you.

12:27.760 --> 12:28.720
Fine.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.160
Zhang Jinran,

12:33.640 --> 12:34.800
I'll give you a bit of courtesy today.

12:36.240 --> 12:38.960
Wei Yan betrayed the convoy.

12:39.600 --> 12:41.320
Throw her into the sea.

12:41.400 --> 12:42.600
Banish her from the convoy!

12:42.680 --> 12:43.520
Yes, sir!

12:45.280 --> 12:46.320
Thank you, Master.

12:49.720 --> 12:50.840
Accountant Wei.

12:52.280 --> 12:53.360
Accountant Wei!

12:57.120 --> 12:58.000
Everyone, clear out.

12:59.280 --> 13:00.440
See you, Master.

13:01.920 --> 13:03.000
-Hurry, let's go!
-Quick, move!

13:14.440 --> 13:15.720
When did you discover Wei Yan's actions?

13:17.240 --> 13:18.400
Last night.

13:19.000 --> 13:20.240
Then why not deal with it last night?

13:20.320 --> 13:22.120
If I'd dealt with it then,

13:22.640 --> 13:25.240
how would I play today's game?

13:25.920 --> 13:27.920
If you had acted last night…

13:30.240 --> 13:31.960
things wouldn't be like this now.

13:32.480 --> 13:34.920
I could have sealed the deal
with the Southern Seas traders.

13:36.200 --> 13:37.560
That's far from enough.

13:39.320 --> 13:40.280
Far from enough?

13:44.720 --> 13:47.400
Buying pearls in Guangzhou
is a big matter,

13:49.560 --> 13:50.640
yet you sent me,

13:51.360 --> 13:53.160
someone that Cui Shijiu considers
as a mere pearl diver.

13:53.920 --> 13:55.880
And you pretended not to see

13:55.960 --> 13:57.640
Wei Yan's dealings with Cui Shijiu,

13:57.720 --> 13:59.440
making her feel too comfortable.

14:00.040 --> 14:02.160
You showed me jewelry and the hairpins

14:02.240 --> 14:04.320
to tempt Shi Nawei

14:04.400 --> 14:05.840
into making pearl hairpins.

14:05.920 --> 14:07.760
But it would be best
if he made this deal with Cui Shijiu.

14:08.360 --> 14:11.280
This way, once pearls become hairpins,

14:11.360 --> 14:12.600
they can't be tribute pearls,

14:12.680 --> 14:14.400
and she'll need to spend a fortune.

14:17.120 --> 14:18.200
You have planned everything.

14:33.880 --> 14:35.200
You're growing smarter by the day.

14:37.960 --> 14:39.960
We're just pawns on your board.

14:42.360 --> 14:43.760
You're not wrong.

14:56.720 --> 14:57.720
Duanwu.

15:01.160 --> 15:02.560
This is what you called

15:04.080 --> 15:04.920
hope?

15:25.240 --> 15:26.200
It hurts…

15:26.280 --> 15:27.760
-Let me blow, and the pain will go away.
-It hurts…

15:28.880 --> 15:29.800
I'll cover it for you.

15:31.160 --> 15:32.400
The pain will go away.

15:33.640 --> 15:35.920
Loud, speak louder.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.360
This is as loud as I get.

15:40.080 --> 15:42.800
Louder, like me.

15:42.880 --> 15:44.800
This is the loudest I can go!

16:01.240 --> 16:03.280
Sister, where did you go just now?

16:04.480 --> 16:06.440
I went to get you something tasty.

16:07.280 --> 16:08.480
Does it still hurt?

16:09.200 --> 16:10.320
No, it doesn't.

16:10.400 --> 16:12.000
If it hurts, tell me. Don't keep it in.

16:16.880 --> 16:19.200
-Do you regret it?
-Regret what?

16:19.800 --> 16:21.240
Running away with me.

16:22.640 --> 16:23.480
No regrets.

16:24.200 --> 16:26.160
I know you care for me most.

16:26.240 --> 16:29.200
Wherever you are, it's not hardship.

16:29.280 --> 16:32.440
Where there's you, there's home.

16:34.120 --> 16:35.440
I'm sorry.

16:36.400 --> 16:37.840
But I promise you,

16:40.040 --> 16:43.960
I'll make a home for you
and protect you well.

16:44.720 --> 16:48.400
Don't bother with Pang Song and Cao,
those petty people.

16:49.240 --> 16:51.040
I believe that one day,

16:51.120 --> 16:54.840
I'll make sure those scoundrels
won't dare to harm us anymore.

16:58.880 --> 17:00.440
Don't worry about it.

17:47.280 --> 17:49.120
Master, we couldn't find Wei Yan.

18:56.240 --> 18:58.880
Nice.

19:02.280 --> 19:03.160
Let's finalize the contract right away.

19:04.680 --> 19:05.520
Hold on!

19:08.600 --> 19:11.040
You wish to sell pearls as hairpins,

19:11.120 --> 19:14.160
but do you know Guangzhou's market?
Where will they be sold?

19:14.240 --> 19:17.400
What are the preferences
and taboos in selling hairpins?

19:19.520 --> 19:20.800
Do you know, my honored guest?

19:22.040 --> 19:23.200
You don't know.

19:24.680 --> 19:26.880
You urged him to enter this business,

19:26.960 --> 19:28.760
-so, do you know?
-I don't know.

19:30.040 --> 19:33.000
I only know
that Yan's Trading Convoy's jewelry

19:33.080 --> 19:34.040
is the finest there is.

19:35.680 --> 19:36.800
Not necessarily.

19:43.960 --> 19:46.360
These are Yan's hairpins from Yangzhou,

19:46.440 --> 19:48.640
once popular among royal families,

19:48.720 --> 19:50.280
highly fashionable at the time.

19:50.360 --> 19:52.080
The design catalog now rests

19:52.160 --> 19:53.880
with my family, the Cui.

19:55.360 --> 19:57.280
Much of the craftsmanship is lost to time,

19:57.360 --> 19:59.360
and only my family can recreate it.

20:06.840 --> 20:10.080
Opening the market
with seven unique hairpin designs…

20:10.600 --> 20:11.440
Wouldn't that be better?

20:15.480 --> 20:17.920
This lacework is quite intricate.

20:18.520 --> 20:20.560
Yan's Trading Convoy sincerely wishes
to work with Mr. Shi.

20:21.200 --> 20:23.480
Besides designs and craftsmen,

20:23.560 --> 20:26.120
we're also willing to invest 30%

20:26.200 --> 20:27.640
as a gesture of goodwill.

20:27.720 --> 20:29.000
Thirty percent?

20:29.880 --> 20:31.160
We will offer 40%.

20:36.640 --> 20:39.360
Are you willing to risk everything
to fight Yan Zijing?

20:41.520 --> 20:42.680
I must acquire

20:43.640 --> 20:45.400
this batch of pearls.

20:47.520 --> 20:48.480
Mr. Shi,

20:49.120 --> 20:50.160
additionally,

20:50.240 --> 20:52.160
I'll add another 500 in deposit,

20:52.240 --> 20:54.600
and we'll split the profits fifty-fifty.

20:55.360 --> 20:57.440
But I want all your future pearls.

20:59.400 --> 21:00.240
Fifty-fifty?

21:01.480 --> 21:02.320
Yes.

21:04.520 --> 21:06.360
Deal.

21:07.240 --> 21:09.640
Then, young miss,

21:09.720 --> 21:12.520
we'll do business another time.

21:18.960 --> 21:20.080
Let me remind you.

21:21.520 --> 21:23.120
If it sells for less than ten million,

21:23.200 --> 21:24.440
it'll be a losing deal.

21:29.080 --> 21:31.600
I heard someone's dead!

21:31.680 --> 21:33.360
-Someone's dead!
-Hurry!

21:34.240 --> 21:35.600
Someone's dead!

21:35.680 --> 21:37.280
-Let's go and look!
-Someone's dead!

21:37.360 --> 21:39.080
-Someone's been killed!
-Go and look!

21:39.160 --> 21:41.240
-Who was it?
-She's been killed!

21:41.320 --> 21:42.840
She's dressed nicely.

21:42.920 --> 21:44.280
I heard she's from the ship.

21:45.000 --> 21:45.960
I don't know her.

21:49.520 --> 21:50.600
How did someone end up dead like this?

21:51.320 --> 21:52.960
I have no idea. It's so frightening.

21:57.960 --> 21:58.800
Accountant Wei!

21:59.320 --> 22:01.320
Someone reported to the governor's office.

22:01.400 --> 22:04.080
They claim to have seen
a murder by the river.

22:05.560 --> 22:08.080
I led the men in searching
for a body along the river,

22:08.760 --> 22:10.280
and sure enough,

22:10.360 --> 22:11.920
we found it.

22:12.560 --> 22:15.440
There's a reward for any informants.

22:15.520 --> 22:16.800
-There's a reward!
-Do you know her?

22:16.880 --> 22:18.200
-I don't know.
-I don't know her either.

22:32.400 --> 22:34.400
Law officer, it's him!

22:34.480 --> 22:37.560
He killed by the riverside last night!

22:37.640 --> 22:39.400
He killed her? That man?

22:40.120 --> 22:41.240
That tall one?

22:44.040 --> 22:45.680
Yesterday, someone saw with their own eyes

22:45.760 --> 22:49.560
that Yan Zijing threw
his accountant Wei Yan overboard.

22:49.640 --> 22:51.560
Today, a fisherman confirmed

22:51.640 --> 22:53.920
that Yan Zijing killed Wei Yan
by the river.

22:54.000 --> 22:57.160
Guards, search his ship top to bottom.

22:57.240 --> 22:58.840
Don't overlook any clues!

22:58.920 --> 22:59.960
Yes, sir!

23:02.360 --> 23:04.200
-Make way! Make way!
-Move aside!

23:05.760 --> 23:06.640
Step back!

23:07.400 --> 23:08.560
Step aside!

23:15.600 --> 23:17.720
Special Envoy Xu, what brings you here?

23:21.240 --> 23:24.200
Master Yan is a distinguished merchant
from Kang.

23:24.800 --> 23:26.200
With such an incident,

23:26.280 --> 23:27.840
how could I not come to see for myself?

23:27.920 --> 23:29.520
It doesn't matter who he is,

23:29.600 --> 23:32.480
whether noble or common,
we follow the rules.

23:32.560 --> 23:33.640
Special Envoy Xu, rest assured.

23:33.720 --> 23:35.760
Naturally, we should
enforce the law fairly.

23:35.840 --> 23:38.600
Then, I won't interfere further.
Go ahead and handle the case.

23:42.040 --> 23:44.760
Law officer, there's blood on this knife.

23:51.840 --> 23:53.840
With both witnesses and evidence,

23:53.920 --> 23:55.600
what else do you have to say?

23:55.680 --> 23:56.720
-Take him away!
-Yes, sir.

23:57.320 --> 23:58.400
Hold on.

24:00.200 --> 24:03.600
Master Yan has extensive dealings
with Guangzhou's jewelry industry.

24:03.680 --> 24:05.520
If he's taken away,

24:05.600 --> 24:07.360
perhaps the government

24:07.880 --> 24:12.440
should keep the cargo on this ship
in custody.

24:12.520 --> 24:14.600
Once the case is resolved,

24:14.680 --> 24:17.520
you can decide what to do with it.

24:17.600 --> 24:19.720
What do you think, Law Officer Zhou?

24:20.720 --> 24:22.000
The murder case isn't closed yet,

24:22.080 --> 24:23.480
so why are you seizing our convoy's goods?

24:23.560 --> 24:25.080
How dare you!

24:25.160 --> 24:26.200
The government is handling this case.

24:26.280 --> 24:28.240
It's not your place to meddle!

24:28.920 --> 24:30.200
Law Officer arrives,

24:30.880 --> 24:32.280
then right after, Special Envoy Xu,

24:32.960 --> 24:33.880
rather convenient timing.

24:33.960 --> 24:36.320
Surely you're not here
just for the jewels on the ship?

24:46.640 --> 24:48.640
Miss, that's not quite right.

24:48.720 --> 24:52.120
While Yan's Trading Convoy
is indeed distinguished,

24:52.720 --> 24:54.720
knowing the law doesn't mean
he can break it

24:54.800 --> 24:56.520
or put himself above the rules.

24:56.600 --> 25:01.160
Besides, with both witnesses and evidence,

25:01.240 --> 25:03.240
the case is ironclad.

25:03.320 --> 25:04.920
Ironclad, you say?

25:14.360 --> 25:16.280
-Senior Brother, you're here.
-Junior Brother.

25:17.520 --> 25:20.800
Securing assets requires
an inventory check first.

25:20.880 --> 25:22.000
We can't handle it carelessly.

25:22.680 --> 25:24.240
Moreover, the case hasn't
even been formally tried.

25:24.920 --> 25:26.200
Even if it were closed,

25:27.560 --> 25:29.200
the goods would need
to go through official auction

25:30.120 --> 25:31.480
and be distributed as per contract,

25:31.560 --> 25:33.800
including compensation
for the victim's family.

25:35.000 --> 25:37.040
You're right, Junior Brother.

25:37.120 --> 25:38.160
But what if

25:39.120 --> 25:42.440
someone on board tries
to smuggle goods and escapes?

25:42.520 --> 25:45.320
What should we do then?

25:46.160 --> 25:47.120
I can assure you,

25:47.200 --> 25:48.920
not a single person from our convoy
will flee!

25:49.000 --> 25:49.840
Right.

25:50.360 --> 25:51.520
No one from the convoy will run.

26:00.440 --> 26:01.960
If you're still concerned,

26:03.520 --> 26:06.200
we can seal everything first
as a preventive measure.

26:07.960 --> 26:09.600
And to show the government's impartiality,

26:11.320 --> 26:13.320
I'll personally seal the goods.

26:14.720 --> 26:15.640
Master Yan,

26:16.480 --> 26:17.440
what do you think?

26:17.520 --> 26:20.120
With Mr. Zhang's guarantee, I'm at ease.

26:24.480 --> 26:27.640
Very well, then.

26:28.440 --> 26:31.560
With Junior Brother's assurance,
I am at ease too.

26:32.160 --> 26:33.560
I have other matters to attend to.

26:34.600 --> 26:35.760
Farewell.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.360
Safe travels, Senior Brother.

26:38.600 --> 26:39.440
Let's go.

26:42.960 --> 26:44.400
Then I'll leave it to you, Mr. Zhang.

26:44.920 --> 26:46.400
I'll take the suspect back.

26:47.000 --> 26:47.960
Thank you.

26:50.400 --> 26:52.520
You, take four men

26:52.600 --> 26:54.400
and assist Mr. Zhang with the seals.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.360
Yes, sir!

26:56.840 --> 26:57.680
Let's go!

26:59.240 --> 27:00.600
My goodness…

27:01.720 --> 27:02.640
What should we do?

27:12.400 --> 27:13.280
Duanwu,

27:14.960 --> 27:16.440
he won't be captured so easily.

27:17.360 --> 27:18.200
I know.

27:19.360 --> 27:20.200
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

27:35.560 --> 27:36.440
Steward Zhao,

27:37.160 --> 27:39.360
they mentioned official auctions earlier.
What does that mean?

27:40.240 --> 27:42.320
The "official auction"
is when the government takes charge,

27:42.400 --> 27:43.240
and brokers organize it.

27:43.320 --> 27:46.600
They'll auction off
the convoy's valuables.

27:47.200 --> 27:48.520
However,

27:48.600 --> 27:51.480
most of the buyers allowed to bid
are insiders.

27:52.000 --> 27:54.240
So, the final sale price
will be quite low.

28:12.000 --> 28:13.440
He said this is what you deserve.

28:13.520 --> 28:16.000
Take it and leave the convoy.

28:21.760 --> 28:22.720
Would he really be that kind?

28:23.400 --> 28:25.560
It was a direct order from him.

28:25.640 --> 28:26.480
When did he give it?

28:28.040 --> 28:30.040
Before killing Wei Yan or after?

28:32.640 --> 28:34.320
Could he have foreseen this outcome?

28:34.400 --> 28:36.560
He said it as they took him away.

28:37.920 --> 28:38.920
As they were taking him,

28:44.160 --> 28:45.680
he still thought of me?

28:45.760 --> 28:46.680
Duanwu,

28:48.000 --> 28:50.040
sometimes you're just too clever.

28:50.640 --> 28:52.480
Now, when you have a chance to leave,
you won't.

28:52.560 --> 28:53.600
Someday,

28:55.080 --> 28:56.760
when you regret it, you won't be able to.

29:02.600 --> 29:04.040
Hurry up!

29:04.120 --> 29:05.160
GUANGZHOU

29:05.240 --> 29:07.560
GOVERNOR'S OFFICE, GUANGZHOU

29:08.160 --> 29:09.320
Law officer, everything is here.

29:11.040 --> 29:13.760
Yan Zijing has confessed
to killing Wei Yan.

29:13.840 --> 29:17.360
I am here under orders to seize
all assets of Yan's Trading Convoy.

29:17.880 --> 29:19.480
-Take everything away!
-Yes, sir!

29:51.880 --> 29:54.440
Steward Zhao,
did Master really commit murder?

29:54.520 --> 29:55.720
Now that he's convicted

29:55.800 --> 29:57.400
and the convoy's goods are confiscated,

29:57.480 --> 29:58.840
-what should we do?
-Yeah.

29:58.920 --> 30:00.440
Is our convoy going to break up?

30:00.520 --> 30:01.960
Can we all leave now?

30:02.040 --> 30:04.560
How are we supposed to go?
There's nothing left to us!

30:04.640 --> 30:05.680
What about our contracts?

30:05.760 --> 30:07.160
Everyone, keep calm!

30:07.240 --> 30:08.280
Stay calm!

30:08.360 --> 30:10.160
Don't worry!

30:10.240 --> 30:12.080
I'll find a way to see Master

30:12.160 --> 30:14.160
and get everyone a satisfactory answer.

30:14.240 --> 30:16.440
Go back and rest. Just go back and rest.

30:17.320 --> 30:18.640
How did it come to this?

30:18.720 --> 30:20.160
Just go back for now.

30:20.240 --> 30:21.520
What else can we do?

30:22.040 --> 30:24.600
Steward Zhao,
regarding the official auction…

30:25.440 --> 30:26.640
Does that mean

30:27.360 --> 30:28.760
we also have the right
to buy our things back?

30:29.360 --> 30:32.040
Technically, yes,
but we don't have the money for it.

30:32.120 --> 30:33.640
We have money! The Master…

30:36.560 --> 30:38.000
-Quickly, speak.
-Wait.

30:38.080 --> 30:39.960
GOVERNOR'S OFFICE, GUANGZHOU

30:42.720 --> 30:45.920
Shi Nawei's pearl shipment
is expected tomorrow.

30:46.000 --> 30:47.240
We can finally breathe easy

30:48.000 --> 30:49.280
about the tribute pearls.

30:49.880 --> 30:52.120
That's your family's business, the Cuis'.

30:54.280 --> 30:55.160
Yes, sir.

30:59.400 --> 31:02.160
I heard Yan Zijing's ship cargo

31:02.240 --> 31:04.040
will go up for an official auction soon.

31:04.720 --> 31:07.360
He had a large quantity of pearls,

31:08.040 --> 31:09.240
all of fine quality.

31:10.520 --> 31:11.920
If we could secure them,

31:12.000 --> 31:14.440
not only would the tribute pearl issue
be solved,

31:14.520 --> 31:16.600
but we could also quickly complete

31:16.680 --> 31:17.880
the Pearl Lotus Terrace for Prince Tan.

31:17.960 --> 31:20.480
Plus, we'd profit considerably.

31:20.560 --> 31:22.920
Though Yan Zijing has confessed,

31:23.000 --> 31:26.680
those goods are under government seal,

31:27.360 --> 31:29.240
outside my jurisdiction.

31:29.840 --> 31:31.600
But, after all,
it's jewelry at the auction,

31:32.120 --> 31:34.120
and Officer Zhou doesn't know
how to handle it.

31:35.400 --> 31:39.240
How many pearls to put up for auction…

31:40.320 --> 31:41.920
isn't it all up to you, Special Envoy Xu?

31:42.600 --> 31:45.800
Ordinarily, it wouldn't be a problem.

31:45.880 --> 31:49.320
But recently, Zhang Jinran
has been watching me closely.

31:49.400 --> 31:52.080
I can't afford to be careless.

31:54.160 --> 31:56.520
But Zhang Jinran
is still just your junior,

31:57.040 --> 31:58.640
merely a scholar.

31:59.440 --> 32:01.560
Surely you have ways

32:01.640 --> 32:02.720
to keep him in check.

32:03.320 --> 32:05.720
Having him as a junior
isn't very important.

32:06.240 --> 32:07.680
But not having him

32:07.760 --> 32:12.840
as a junior right now is crucial.

32:15.000 --> 32:15.920
Yes, sir.

32:17.040 --> 32:18.880
Since this official auction

32:18.960 --> 32:21.480
involves tribute pearls
and the Pearl Lotus Terrace,

32:22.280 --> 32:23.480
your Cui family

32:24.120 --> 32:27.640
should be well-prepared financially

32:27.720 --> 32:30.160
to ensure everything goes smoothly.

32:30.880 --> 32:31.760
Naturally.

32:32.400 --> 32:33.320
Very good.

32:38.160 --> 32:40.120
That old fox Xu Nanying wants me

32:40.640 --> 32:42.240
to pay for the auction,

32:42.760 --> 32:44.760
all while raking in countless benefits!

32:46.240 --> 32:47.880
Master Shijiu, no need to worry.

32:48.640 --> 32:50.440
Once Shi Nawei's
second shipment of pearls arrives,

32:50.520 --> 32:52.440
the tribute pearl issue will be resolved.

32:52.520 --> 32:54.920
Then, we won't have
to let that fox drain us dry.

33:01.760 --> 33:03.800
Let's go check on Shi Nawei's shipment.

33:04.800 --> 33:05.680
Yes, sir.

33:08.640 --> 33:10.800
The pearls might not arrive?
What do you mean?

33:11.760 --> 33:13.640
There was a storm at sea.

33:13.720 --> 33:15.080
When will they arrive?

33:15.160 --> 33:17.360
Even I couldn't say for sure
when they'll arrive.

33:17.960 --> 33:19.960
But we signed a contract.

33:20.040 --> 33:21.320
Are you trying to back out?

33:22.240 --> 33:24.200
You paid a high price upfront.

33:24.280 --> 33:26.400
I should compensate double.

33:27.760 --> 33:30.920
However,
as clearly written in the contract,

33:31.000 --> 33:33.520
sea transport is unpredictable,

33:33.600 --> 33:36.640
and delivery depends on circumstances.

33:41.400 --> 33:42.520
Master Shijiu, don't be upset.

33:42.600 --> 33:44.160
Although this shipment hasn't arrived,

33:44.240 --> 33:46.400
the next one is coming soon.

33:46.480 --> 33:49.160
Master Shijiu, my goal

33:49.240 --> 33:51.280
is to work with you long-term.

33:53.240 --> 33:54.840
Then, when will the next shipment arrive?

33:55.480 --> 33:57.520
It's already on its way,

33:57.600 --> 34:00.560
estimated to take over two months.

34:01.160 --> 34:02.240
Two months?

34:03.600 --> 34:05.560
The tribute deadline
is in less than ten days.

34:05.640 --> 34:06.840
What are we supposed to do?

34:09.400 --> 34:11.120
Don't worry, Master Shijiu.

34:11.639 --> 34:15.600
I knew you'd need this batch urgently,

34:16.120 --> 34:19.639
so I had the pearls
pre-drilled and inlaid.

34:20.320 --> 34:21.639
Once they arrive,

34:21.719 --> 34:24.440
your craftsmen can start right away.

34:24.520 --> 34:25.560
Drilled?

34:26.719 --> 34:29.080
Who gave you the authority to drill them?

34:29.159 --> 34:30.880
What use do I have for pre-drilled pearls?

34:31.480 --> 34:34.000
Pearls made into jewelry need
to be drilled, don't they?

34:35.000 --> 34:38.000
Master Shijiu, I was helping you.

34:40.800 --> 34:44.080
Unless you had other plans for them?

34:50.639 --> 34:52.920
What I intend to do
is none of your concern.

34:53.880 --> 34:56.280
I have no use for these drilled pearls.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.360
Hey…

35:12.840 --> 35:15.600
Master Shijiu, this is the head
of the Yue family from Shaozhou.

35:15.680 --> 35:16.920
He has been waiting here for a while.

35:17.000 --> 35:18.480
Shaozhou's Yue family?

35:19.840 --> 35:20.760
The Yue family from Shaozhou,

35:20.840 --> 35:23.400
renowned for jade carving,
has a history with our family.

35:23.480 --> 35:25.680
Greetings, Master Shijiu.

35:26.360 --> 35:30.040
I am Yue Xun, head of the Yue family.

35:30.120 --> 35:32.000
My father never mentioned you.

35:32.080 --> 35:32.920
State your business.

35:35.520 --> 35:37.680
Traditionally, around this time each year,

35:37.760 --> 35:40.440
the Cui's Pearl Farm would send
ten taels of pearls

35:40.520 --> 35:42.800
to the Yue family.

35:42.880 --> 35:45.520
But this year, they never arrived,

35:45.600 --> 35:47.960
so I personally went to Hepu,

35:48.040 --> 35:49.520
-and then--
-Are you implying

35:49.600 --> 35:51.640
Cui Ding colluded with you

35:51.720 --> 35:53.280
to steal our family's pearls?

35:57.080 --> 35:58.680
Master Shijiu, I knew nothing of this.

35:58.760 --> 36:01.080
This was a promise made

36:01.160 --> 36:03.200
by the head of the Cui family years ago.

36:03.280 --> 36:04.880
What's this nonsense?

36:05.680 --> 36:08.160
On what grounds did my father
promise you ten taels annually?

36:12.160 --> 36:17.640
Lady Cui, are you aware
that the Cui family has a lotus terrace,

36:17.720 --> 36:20.240
-and there was an apsaras statue--
-Mr. Yue,

36:20.320 --> 36:21.480
I won't give up a single pearl

36:21.560 --> 36:23.320
without a signed certificate
from my family

36:23.400 --> 36:26.160
or my father's confirmation.

36:26.240 --> 36:29.720
If everyone came asking
for ten taels of pearls,

36:29.800 --> 36:31.400
our family would be drained dry by now.

36:31.480 --> 36:34.040
I have no time for idle chatter.

36:34.120 --> 36:35.080
See him out.

36:35.160 --> 36:38.040
You… You little girl!

36:38.120 --> 36:40.520
You truly don't understand
who you're dealing with!

36:41.280 --> 36:43.080
I'll go speak to Cui Jingchu myself!

36:48.920 --> 36:51.800
-What's wrong with Master Shijiu?
-Shi Nawei's second shipment can't arrive.

36:53.920 --> 36:54.760
Master Shijiu,

36:54.840 --> 36:56.400
if worse comes to worst,
we still have the official auction.

36:56.480 --> 37:00.120
Though that old fox Xu Nanying is greedy,
the most pressing issue now

37:00.200 --> 37:02.120
is resolving the tribute pearl problem.

37:02.200 --> 37:03.280
We still have the official auction…

37:04.200 --> 37:05.760
Yan Zijing still has pearls.

37:06.520 --> 37:07.680
But, Master Shijiu,

37:07.760 --> 37:11.320
we've already invested heavily
in jewelry with Shi Nawei.

37:11.400 --> 37:13.120
There's barely any money left
in our accounts.

37:13.200 --> 37:15.000
With so many shops in Guangzhou,

37:15.080 --> 37:16.800
surely we can gather enough funds.

37:16.880 --> 37:18.440
We've raised all we can.

37:18.520 --> 37:21.560
Raising more could ruin
all of Guangzhou's businesses.

37:25.880 --> 37:28.360
Master Shijiu, please
inform the head of the family!

37:28.440 --> 37:29.760
-Master Shijiu, I beg you!
-Yes, please!

37:29.840 --> 37:31.560
Only the family head can resolve this now.

37:31.640 --> 37:33.120
-Just speak with him…
-Master Shijiu…

37:33.200 --> 37:34.480
No!

37:37.120 --> 37:38.680
What am I supposed to tell my father?

37:39.200 --> 37:41.120
What should I report to him?

37:42.720 --> 37:45.560
He is old, and his health is poor.

37:46.600 --> 37:49.160
The tribute pearls burned,
and the pearl farm was destroyed.

37:49.240 --> 37:52.480
Such disaster has befallen the Cui family,
and none of my brothers helped.

37:53.080 --> 37:55.760
They're just waiting for him to pass,

37:55.840 --> 37:57.160
eager to divide the inheritance.

37:58.240 --> 37:59.880
What am I supposed to tell him?

38:00.920 --> 38:04.240
That even though I tried my hardest,

38:04.320 --> 38:08.200
I've lost everything, with no way out?

38:09.160 --> 38:11.120
What am I supposed to tell him?

38:12.000 --> 38:13.640
If the tribute pearls are compromised,

38:13.720 --> 38:17.320
-the entire Cui family will be executed!
-Yes, Master Shijiu…

38:17.400 --> 38:18.480
-Master Shijiu…
-Master Shijiu…

38:18.560 --> 38:20.040
-Please think it through, Master Shijiu.
-Master Shijiu…

38:20.120 --> 38:21.480
Otherwise, we'll all be doomed!

38:21.560 --> 38:23.840
-Please, inform the family head!
-Master Shijiu!

38:23.920 --> 38:25.800
-Master Shijiu…
-Master Shijiu…

38:26.960 --> 38:28.520
-Master Shijiu…
-Master Shijiu…

38:29.280 --> 38:30.160
Master Shijiu,

38:30.240 --> 38:31.120
I beg you…

38:42.640 --> 38:43.880
Be gentle!

38:45.080 --> 38:46.160
Quick!

38:56.560 --> 38:57.520
Be careful!

38:58.080 --> 38:59.720
Careful!

39:30.600 --> 39:32.960
Assistant Pang! Look, we found it!

39:36.920 --> 39:38.760
Turns out they were hiding jewels!

39:39.280 --> 39:40.720
It's a pity there's so few,

39:40.800 --> 39:41.800
but it's still not bad.

39:41.880 --> 39:44.200
The authorities have taken
everything they needed.

39:44.280 --> 39:46.360
So, having these left is pure luck.

39:46.440 --> 39:49.040
It's enough for us to enjoy ourselves!

40:10.160 --> 40:12.200
Supervisor Kang, spare us!

40:12.840 --> 40:13.920
The Master isn't here.

40:15.040 --> 40:16.880
That doesn't give you the right
to steal from the convoy.

40:16.960 --> 40:20.160
-Supervisor Kang, have mercy!
-Assistant Pang,

40:20.240 --> 40:22.000
what's the punishment for stealing

40:23.280 --> 40:24.200
from the convoy?

40:25.240 --> 40:26.120
Now I get it.

40:26.200 --> 40:28.680
You set us up!

40:28.760 --> 40:29.600
What of it?

40:29.680 --> 40:32.560
You said there were treasures
in the Master's room…

40:32.640 --> 40:33.680
Yes, I did.

40:35.480 --> 40:36.400
But…

40:38.640 --> 40:40.280
did I force you to steal, Assistant Pang?

40:40.880 --> 40:42.960
We only intended
to check the Master's room

40:43.040 --> 40:45.320
to see if anything valuable was left.

40:45.400 --> 40:46.960
-Right.
-Right.

40:48.120 --> 40:49.160
Shrimp.

40:50.640 --> 40:52.960
Everyone, look
at Pang Song and Cao's actions!

40:53.040 --> 40:55.120
They took valuables before the seizure.

40:55.840 --> 40:57.280
They wrapped them in oil paper,

40:57.360 --> 40:59.200
tied them to stones,
and threw them into the sea.

40:59.280 --> 41:02.440
They planned to retrieve them later.

41:02.520 --> 41:03.800
Look, everyone!

41:03.880 --> 41:05.040
Nonsense!

41:05.120 --> 41:06.240
Steward Zhao, you see!

41:06.320 --> 41:08.960
Cao did it all! I had no part in it!

41:09.040 --> 41:10.200
You're lying!

41:10.280 --> 41:11.560
I've never seen this before!

41:11.640 --> 41:14.520
And I only took a small cut
of the profits,

41:14.600 --> 41:16.120
and the rest went to him!

41:16.200 --> 41:18.920
You're lying! You're slandering me!

41:19.000 --> 41:20.680
You're the one slandering!

41:21.680 --> 41:23.000
Duanwu, listen,

41:23.080 --> 41:25.000
we have no grudge between us!

41:25.080 --> 41:27.880
Shrimp's suffering was all Cao Da's doing!

41:27.960 --> 41:30.120
I knew nothing of it!

41:30.200 --> 41:31.680
You're just jealous

41:31.760 --> 41:34.080
that Duanwu got to do big business
with Accountant Wei,

41:34.160 --> 41:36.240
so you had me scheme against Shrimp!

41:36.320 --> 41:37.600
You…!

41:40.240 --> 41:41.800
-Well deserved!
-Well deserved!

41:43.200 --> 41:45.000
You two colluded

41:45.640 --> 41:47.120
in Master's absence,

41:47.640 --> 41:48.600
stealing from the convoy.

41:49.400 --> 41:50.240
Well said!

41:52.000 --> 41:53.760
As head of the convoy's attendants,

41:53.840 --> 41:57.000
you exploited them,
stealing their hard-earned money!

41:57.080 --> 42:00.320
You also colluded with Wu Xiang

42:00.840 --> 42:02.880
to steal scraps to frame me.

42:04.840 --> 42:05.760
Well deserved!

42:05.840 --> 42:07.840
-Hit him!
-And you,

42:07.920 --> 42:08.960
you hit my brother.

42:10.800 --> 42:12.480
He's just a child.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.280
Enough!

42:17.840 --> 42:21.480
-Mr. Zhang, save me!
-Save me!

42:22.560 --> 42:23.400
Duanwu,

42:24.480 --> 42:27.240
abusing your power like this,
how are you different from Yan Zijing?

42:27.760 --> 42:31.080
They're despicable people.
Why do you bother with them?

42:31.160 --> 42:33.560
How have you come to be like this now?
